": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6YkAqj_uPo4Q7kNvwHUfW3M&_nc_oc=AdoCZhuBkkA-iVWam1Zp09yygvzfWFmRMA7korF7cspjAONWhMlk2aAdPD5ykq2YkQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIRfZ_HcK31-KBKgNVUpMZo-y3a_yc63YOO4ocu5rpXdg&oe=6A9FFA5B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bYk9YO1pyvIQ7kNvwHzcY_7&_nc_oc=Adozq0oJMOcjh-iG-R1-HD8n4my94uRsNB0Res5s-CoPCECmuVhotAhUdylnlN_o3Cg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6TxIq4nD1YJaxj2rn4Ha07k7vvmX-RGjEPipfvRbjrg&oe=6AA022E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hoe9lI9cPywQ7kNvwFkraRe&_nc_oc=Adqd0_4Ws4APYFeKI48uBtBJCMjQ1af-oniOiJG69hvHLzDpd-u3CF13OmlntEIJUYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLQq-c3DDjPrpen0poJzlTdb30aBTa_Dd4EaUqBBLMaGA&oe=6AA00FAF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RyxogbBFX24Q7kNvwH2a1e0&_nc_oc=AdqccWBW81xUzYuvCtiDg8pXEEGoz62q_Q8VNja0al5N03eP-iiTgY4g-nImc064v_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIGpLwgZ6kNQkmv-nHod6j_apF5a-0zHN8m-cSjofPInA&oe=6AA00F52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YLisxChRx9gQ7kNvwFh1zQZ&_nc_oc=AdrRF9tTCH6IkR1PsFX1j2lgzNJXmr936BWlydg3fDeW574iHteKdlnPTb0BYsvkm7g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI0tE2XI9Q9PE9Js7Vu1tPRS-PnzYsKyag3te8QxEDAJg&oe=6AA018FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a